[00:17.08]1. When our love is pure and intense,
[00:22.58]We make Jehovah’s heart rejoice.
[00:27.88]Love is his greatest quality,
[00:33.36]Something that we hold dear.
[00:38.84]Warm affection glows in our hearts,
[00:44.32]Making a loyal friendship grow.
[00:49.82]Love always acts unselfishly,
[00:55.29]Proving our love sincere.
[01:01.05]When we see a friend in need,
[01:06.05]We’ll be there to lend a helping hand.
[01:11.05]Truly we can be a friend,
[01:17.05]Someone who can understand.
[01:23.13]Jesus showed what love really means,
[01:28.13]Helping us see Jehovah’s love,
[01:34.13]Touching our hearts and moving us.
[01:39.13]Tender feelings are a start.
[01:45.13]Love intensely from the heart.